WEBVTT

00:11:26.470 --> 00:11:30.282
„Bet tas ir mans sapnis!
Es sapņoju tieši par to.”

00:11:30.292 --> 00:11:32.311
Un ko teiksiet jūs?

00:11:32.335 --> 00:11:33.977
Ziniet, ko teiksiet?

00:11:34.001 --> 00:11:37.037
„Paklau, bērns.
Arī man reiz bija sapnis, bet..

00:11:38.713 --> 00:11:42.693
Kā pabeigsiet šo
teikumu ar savu „bet”?

00:11:42.717 --> 00:11:48.728
„Arī man reiz bija sapnis, 
bet man bija bail to īstenot.”

00:11:48.781 --> 00:11:50.200
Vai teiksiet viņiem:

00:11:51.384 --> 00:11:53.796
„Man reiz bija sapnis, mans bērns.

00:11:55.001 --> 00:11:56.703
Bet tad piedzimi tu.”

00:11:56.727 --> 00:11:58.347
(Smiekli)

00:11:59.061 --> 00:12:00.563
(Aplausi)